│ To resolve the issue described, we need to examine the RadioSelect │
│ widget in the context of the ModelForm and the ForeignKey field    │
│ that is required (blank=False). The key is to understand how the   │
│ RadioSelect widget behaves when a field is required and whether it │
│ includes a blank option.                                           │
│                                                                    │
│ ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── │
